    {
      "id": 209,
      "text": "With the trap triggered, the lock is quickly defeated.  Inside, you find treasure.",
      "authored": false,
      "provenance": {"sourceFile": "Data SD2", "recordIndex": 209, "byteOffset": 53504, "byteLength": 256, "confidence": "source-backed"}
    },
    {
      "id": 210,
      "text": "You hear a click as a trap disarms and the lock opens.  Inside you find treasure.",
      "authored": false,
      "provenance": {"sourceFile": "Data SD2", "recordIndex": 210, "byteOffset": 53760, "byteLength": 256, "confidence": "source-backed"}
    },
    {
      "id": 218,
      "text": "The door to this chamber is locked.  It is made of quite solid oak.",
      "authored": false,
      "provenance": {"sourceFile": "Data SD2", "recordIndex": 218, "byteOffset": 55808, "byteLength": 256, "confidence": "source-backed"}
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "text": "You enter the guard house outside the main gate to Castle Anthrax.  Several guards keep a wary eye on you as you approach the head Magistrate.  He is a stately looking man in fine robes.",
      "authored": false,
      "provenance": {"sourceFile": "Data SD2", "recordIndex": 50, "byteOffset": 12800, "byteLength": 256, "confidence": "source-backed"}
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "text": "Judging by the man's large girth, robes are not all he fancies.  You approach his fine oak desk.  \"Present your invitation so I may validate it for passage to yon castle.\"",
      "authored": false,
      "provenance": {"sourceFile": "Data SD2", "recordIndex": 51, "byteOffset": 13056, "byteLength": 256, "confidence": "source-backed"}
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "text": "You have entered a rather fine tavern filled with only the best citizens of Bywater.  Most of the tables are filled with patrons eating spiced potatoes and engaged in interesting discussions.  You find yourself a table near the back.",
      "authored": false,
      "provenance": {"sourceFile": "Data SD2", "recordIndex": 75, "byteOffset": 19200, "byteLength": 256, "confidence": "source-backed"}
    },
    {
      "id": 76,
      "text": "You are standing in a tavern.",
      "authored": false,
      "provenance": {"sourceFile": "Data SD2", "recordIndex": 76, "byteOffset": 19456, "byteLength": 256, "confidence": "source-backed"}
    },
    {
      "id": 86,
      "text": "\"Oh, I don't really know much.\"  She smiles and points to the seedy looking man.  \"Ask him, he's been telling me all kinds of stories all day.\"",
      "authored": false,
      "provenance": {"sourceFile": "Data SD2", "recordIndex": 86, "byteOffset": 22016, "byteLength": 256, "confidence": "source-backed"}
    },
    {
      "id": 91,
      "text": "They make for the door in haste, yelling, \"Targ the thief has gotten his due! Any man who follows us shall join him in Hades!\"  Apparently, they did not see the slip of paper Targ gave you.",
      "authored": false,
      "provenance": {"sourceFile": "Data SD2", "recordIndex": 91, "byteOffset": 23296, "byteLength": 256, "confidence": "source-backed"}
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "text": "You are at your table when the town guards show up.  Luckily, nobody wants to get so involved as to implicate you in any manner.  The guards bind Targ's arms to his chest and drag him from the inn.",
      "authored": false,
      "provenance": {"sourceFile": "Data SD2", "recordIndex": 94, "byteOffset": 24064, "byteLength": 256, "confidence": "source-backed"}
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "text": "As you examine the slip of paper, you see that it's a map describing the location of an old crypt in the graveyard.",
      "authored": false,
      "provenance": {"sourceFile": "Data SD2", "recordIndex": 95, "byteOffset": 24320, "byteLength": 256, "confidence": "source-backed"}
    },
    {
      "id": 620,
      "text": "You enter the slave prison.  A potbellied Corporal Sampson is slumped over a shaky table.  He's slept through the entire ordeal that just took place outside.  The smell of elderberry wine permeates his clothes.  You try to rouse him to collect your fee.",
      "authored": false,
      "provenance": {"sourceFile": "Data SD2", "recordIndex": 620, "byteOffset": 158720, "byteLength": 256, "confidence": "source-backed"}
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "text": "He bids you farewell as you make your way from the gate house.",
      "authored": false,
      "provenance": {"sourceFile": "Data SD2", "recordIndex": 61, "byteOffset": 15616, "byteLength": 256, "confidence": "source-backed"}
    },
    {
      "id": 180,
      "text": "This appears to be the site of a rather large cavern that has recently caved in.",
      "authored": false,
      "provenance": {"sourceFile": "Data SD2", "recordIndex": 180, "byteOffset": 46080, "byteLength": 256, "confidence": "source-backed"}
    },
    {
      "id": 183,
      "text": "You have succeeded in uncovering the passage behind the cave-in.  It is now  possible to traverse the passage to wherever it may take you.",
      "authored": false,
      "provenance": {"sourceFile": "Data SD2", "recordIndex": 183, "byteOffset": 46848, "byteLength": 256, "confidence": "source-backed"}
    },
    {
      "id": 185,
      "text": "The tunnel continues west.  You smell decaying flesh.  The odor is almost overwhelming.",
      "authored": false,
      "provenance": {"sourceFile": "Data SD2", "recordIndex": 185, "byteOffset": 47360, "byteLength": 256, "confidence": "source-backed"}
    }
  ],
